WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.890
Sikh tradition speaks of 8.4 million forms
of life that a soul can pass through.

2
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.940
Among them, a human birth
is rare and precious.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.810
And Sikhs believe actions
carry consequences,

4
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.710
from one life to the next.

5
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.460
That is karma.

6
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.110
So if your actions decide your next life,

7
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.960
how can a gift from God set you free?

8
00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.810
In this mission, you'll
trace the soul's journey,

9
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:28.120
and what Sikhs mean by mukti, liberation.

10
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.920
Then you'll test what karma means for
a Sikh boy born into a poor family.

11
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:38.530
Your mission: find out how, for Sikhs,
a gift from God can set a soul free.
